1171+ 7873 C5               push bc
1172+ 7874 78               ld   a, b
1173+ 7875 C6 0F            add  a, 15
1174+ 7877 47               ld   b, a
1175+ 7878 CD 32 78         call CheckWallCell
1176+ 787B 38 03            jr   c, .collision
1177+ 787D
1178+ 787D C1               pop  bc
1179+ 787E B7               or   a                 ; Reset carry (nessuna collisione)
1180+ 787F C9               ret
