1255+ 78E1              .store_cell:
1256+ 78E1 12               ld   (de), a
1257+ 78E2 13               inc  de
1258+ 78E3 0B               dec  bc
1259+ 78E4 78               ld   a, b
1260+ 78E5 B1               or   c
