  19+ 7CC9              ; Offset 6: Direction (1 = Left/Up, 2 = Right/Down)
  20+ 7CC9              ; Offset 7: Anim State (0..3)
  21+ 7CC9              ; Offset 8: Old X
  22+ 7CC9              ; Offset 9: Old Y
  23+ 7CC9              ; Offset 10: Color (Attributo Spectrum)
