 660+ 82AA              ; Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore
 661+ 82AA              ; Se player_score > high_score, copia player_score in high_score.
 662+ 82AA              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------
 663+ 82AA              Score_CheckAndUpdateHighScore:
 664+ 82AA                  ; Confronto BCD a 3 byte (big-endian: byte 2 -> byte 1 -> byte 0)
 665+ 82AA                  ; Byte 2:
